# Prophetica referral production workers.
#
# Required environment:
# - REFERRAL_SERVICE_DATABASE_URL or DATABASE_URL
# - WALLET_LEDGER_BASE_URL
# - WALLET_LEDGER_DATABASE_URL for trade-accrual and direct qualification input mode
# - REFERRAL_QUALIFICATION_INPUT_BASE_URL for daily-qualification HTTP input mode, or
# - KYC_SERVICE_DATABASE_URL and WALLET_LEDGER_DATABASE_URL for direct Postgres input mode
#
# Runs after UTC/Taipei daily ledger cutover window. The payout worker is idempotent at
# wallet-ledger-service via `referral-commission-payout:{referrer}:{epoch_day}`
# and at referral-service via `paid_out_txn_id`.
00 18 * * * REFERRAL_WORKER_MODE=daily-qualification referral-worker
10 18 * * * REFERRAL_WORKER_MODE=trade-accrual referral-worker
15 18 * * * REFERRAL_WORKER_MODE=daily-payout referral-worker
